<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69600" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μωρ-αίνω</span></b> , fut. -<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰνῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Med.</u>
					614
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμώρᾱνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					719
				</span></i>
			 (troch.): —
				Pass.
			, v. infr. <i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῶρος</span>):—<i>to be
				silly, foolish, drivel</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				1.1.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mus.</u>
				p.103K.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Nav.</u>
				45
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>play the fool</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1148b2
			</span></i>: c. acc. cogn., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεῖραν μ.</span>
			<i>make a mad</i> attempt, <i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i> l.c.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδεὶς . . ταῦτα μωραίνει</span>
			<i>indulges in</i> these <i>follies</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				282.22
			</span></i>: euphem. of illicit love, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυναῖκα μωραίνουσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					674
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> causal,
				<i>make foolish, convict of folly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ βουλὴ αὐτῶν μωρανθήσεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Is.</u>
					19.11
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμωράνθην σφόδρα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>2 Ki.</u>
				24.10
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Cor.</u>
				1.20
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to become foolish, be stupefied</i>, [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἶγες] ἑστᾶσιν ὥσπερ μεμωραμμέναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					610b30
				</span></i>
			 (sed cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μωρόομαι</span>); <i>to
				become insipid</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐὰν τὸ ἅλας μωρανθῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
					5.13
				</span></i>
			.</div>
